{"id":"rede","lemma":"Rede","pos":"noun","rank":409,"glosses":["speech, address"],"ipa":"/ˈreːdə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/38/De-at-Rede.ogg/De-at-Rede.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Rede","plural":"Reden"},"examples":[{"text":"Muss ich eine Rede halten?","en":"Do I have to make a speech?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/566424","words":[{"g":"to have to","l":"müssen"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to hold"}]},{"text":"Rede ich dir zu viel?","en":"Do you think I talk too much?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/698755","words":[null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"too much"]]},{"text":"Seine Rede war zu kurz.","en":"His speech was too short.","words":[{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},null,{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"short, quick, brief"}]},{"text":"Das war eine sehr gute Rede.","en":"That was a very good speech.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"very"},{"g":"good","l":"gut"},null]},{"text":"Seine Rede hat uns sehr beeindruckt.","en":"His speech impressed us very much.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/41662","words":[{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},null,{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"},{"g":"very"},{"g":"to impress, to impose","l":"beeindrucken"}]}]}